&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;8,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Databases:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience structuring document databases (Firestore) and querying analytical data warehouses (BigQuery).&lt;/p&gt;
