&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;9631&quot; data-local-id=&quot;26ccc5a7d40e&quot;&gt;Solid understanding of GPU computing, including ML training, inference workloads, and GPU stacks (e.g., CUDA, OpenCL).&lt;/li&gt;
