lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive technical execution&lt;/strong&gt; by designing, building, and scaling Android applications that handle complex, real-time interactions at a global scale.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead architectural improvements&lt;/strong&gt; and code reviews, ensuring the maintainability, visibility, and operational health of our mobile codebase.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner with cross-functional disciplines&lt;/strong&gt; (PMs, Experience Designers) to plan projects, assist with technical choices, and influence the team roadmap.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own large-scale features&lt;/strong&gt; from design to delivery, simplifying maintenance and promoting operational readiness across our production systems.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support the growth of others&lt;/strong&gt; by mentoring colleagues, encouraging efficiency, and taking an active role in our engineering hiring process.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3&gt;What You’ll Need to Thrive&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Our ideal candidate will bring strong expertise in some of these areas and curiosity to grow in others:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Significant experience in building Android applications at scale&lt;/strong&gt;, with a deep understanding of the Android SDK, AndroidX, and modern development tools like Android Studio.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven ability to scale Android architecture&lt;/strong&gt;, delivering high-performance mobile experiences in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong proficiency in Kotlin and/or Java&lt;/strong&gt;, with a keen interest in continuing to push the boundaries of what&#39;s possible with Kotlin.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Demonstrated ownership of technical delivery&lt;/strong&gt; within cross-functional teams, guiding implementation choices and technical design.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A pride in software craft&lt;/strong&gt;, with a commitment to writing readable, well-designed, and thoroughly tested mobile code.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Why Join Us?&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Deliveroo, you’ll do work that matters—solving real-world problems in a three-sided marketplace that’s constantly evolving. We’re food lovers, problem solvers, community builders and more, brought together by a shared drive to make things better. Working here you can expect to:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;🔧 &lt;strong&gt;Solve meaningful problems at real scale&lt;/strong&gt; Work on a complex, always-on marketplace that impacts millions every day.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;🌱 &lt;strong&gt;See your impact, fast&lt;/strong&gt; Ship, test and improve ideas quickly in a low-hierarchy, high-ownership environment.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;🧠 &lt;strong&gt;Grow through challenge and ownership&lt;/strong&gt; Take on big, ambiguous problems and accelerate your career with strong support.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;🌎 &lt;strong&gt;A culture built for builders&lt;/strong&gt; High standards, collaboration, flexible working and continuous learning.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;💰 &lt;strong&gt;Share in the success you help create&lt;/strong&gt; Competitive salary and equity options, so you’re rewarded for the impact you make.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;➡️ Want a deeper look at how we build? Check out our &lt;a target=&quot;_blank&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; href=&quot;https://deliveroo.engineering&quot;&gt;Tech Blog&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;We aim to create a fair process that lets your skills shine—our interview typically includes 3-4 stages. &lt;a target=&quot;_blank&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; href=&quot;https://careers.deliveroo.co.uk/interview-guide-for-engineers/&quot;&gt;Explore our Engineering Interview Guide here&lt;/a&gt; to help you feel confident at each stage.&lt;/p&gt;&l